# Wealth inequality, white males vs white females, 1990 -> 1996

Main design: two **cross-sectional slices** per group per year (no pooling). Layers:
`A_raw` = zero is a true zero (MAIN) | `C_positive` = strictly positive only (REQUIRED COMPANION)
| `B_bound` = 1996 zeros read as nonresponse (SENSITIVITY BOUND ONLY).
R = 2000 bootstrap, percentile 95% CI. Source columns: `race`, `sex`, `ever_jailed`,
`composite_wealth_1990`, `composite_wealth_1996` (1985 unused except as descriptive context).

